                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                                <span class="text-teal-600 font-bold text-base shrink-0">✓</span>
                                <div><strong>Teen & Young Adult Aesthetic Braces:</strong> Low-profile ceramic aesthetic brackets and discreet aligners that correct crowding without awkward wires[cite: 1].</div>
